SUMMARY:Let's Walk!! in Briant Park
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nLet’s enjoy this gorgeous day by walking 3-5 m
 iles in the wonderful Briant Park.\n\nThis park is located in Summit\, NJ 
 and has a Fitness Trail\, Multi-use Path\, Fishing and Ice Skating.\n1 loo
 p= 1 mile\nSmall inclines\n\nWear comfortable shoes and bring some water!\
 n\n301 Shunpike Rd\, Springfield\, NJ 07081 - use the link in the map belo
 w.\n\nRain or extreme weather will cancel the event.\n\nDisclaimer: If you
  join us for a hike/walk\, please understand that you are responsible for 
 your own preparedness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in c
 ase of injury or mishap.
