BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_314617393@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260516T035253Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260619T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260619T110000
SUMMARY:South Mountain Crest Trail 
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nLet's Walk!! in South Mountain and visit Washing
 ton Rock and traverse a few of the many trails in the Reservation.\n\nWash
 ington Rock is Essex County Park System's bona fide Revolutionary War hist
 oric site\, dating back to the late 1700's when Beacon Signal Station 9 wa
 s located here—one of 23 beacons built by General Washington to observe 
 British troop movements quartered on Staten Island and New York City.\n\nS
 eems like a great place to remember the nation's 250th birthday\n\nThis hi
 ke will be about 3-3.5 miles and mostly flat. The terrain is mostly dirt t
 rails in the woods\, so please wear sturdy hiking boots. **Bug spray and p
 rotective clothing is a good idea.**\n\nPlease arrive a few minutes early.
  We start promptly at the time posted. The hike should take us 60-90 minut
 es. **Please remember to bring water!**\n\nInclement weather may cancel th
 is event. Please check the event page for comments prior to leaving for th
 e meetup.\n\n**Disclaimer:** If you join this event\, please understand th
 at you are responsible for your own preparedness and well-being and will h
 old no one else liable in case of injury or mishap.\n\n*photo by Angel Mad
 ison*
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/314617393/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260503T223109Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260503T223109Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
